tests/tui/job-control-suspend-pty.test.ts  # real-PTY job-control test: CI Job container cannot keep a process stopped (runtime re-sends SIGCONT after SIGSTOP, same quirk as tmux panes), so the OS-state assertion cannot pass headless; verified locally (3 fresh PTY sessions: T after Ctrl+Z, S after fg, shell 'Stopped'). Mechanism covered by tests/tui/job-control-suspend.test.ts source-assertions. (sara, 2026-08-20)
